configured by hand with xf86config, but almost same happened
when I said startx.

With xf86cfg
 - there was a brief pause where I could see the cursor blinking
   at the top of the screen
 - monitor lost sync (at this point pings still got through)
 - sync came back briefly
 - and then want away again, and everything stopped; I couldn't
   ping the machine anymore

After configuring by hand and startx, all I could see was the
cursor blinking away. Nothing else helped expect reset button.

I'm attaching my dmesg, kernel config and the XFree86 log that
I got from the xf86cfg run (apparently no log from startx).

  -- Arto

